    <summary>Cryptographic Triangles (TRI) node + wallet — tri7 Rust rewrite with PoS staking, Tor and I2P, encrypted messaging, built-in explorer.</summary>
    <description>
Cryptographic Triangles (TRI) is a privacy-focused cryptocurrency featuring
Proof-of-Stake consensus, Tor v3 onion routing AND I2P (dual-network,
first-class), encrypted peer-to-peer messaging (smsg), and a built-in local
block explorer.

tri7 is the modern Rust rewrite of the original 2014 client (Hash9 algorithm):
a lightweight daemon (tri7d) and an egui wallet GUI. This package installs the
official NSIS setup (per-user, into %LOCALAPPDATA%\Tri7Wallet, with Start
Menu / Desktop shortcuts and Add/Remove Programs entries).
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SamiAhmed7777/tri7/releases/tag/v7.0.0</releaseNotes>
